{"c":[{"name":"20261007T144012Z-ef6cc9d6c94c61fb","text":"I3 ruling: an Ask never refuses for unclear fields or a too-long question; Jev's settled fields fill, unclear ones are asked beside them (AskIntent.sure) only when <= 8, else listed as left to the user (AskIntent.unsure).","type":"note"},{"name":"20261007T162248Z-4dec6eda4a1a65ff","text":"Chrome AX shows a closed select's selected option only, so realfill-asks' default reader desk has no menu options; --form-window page uses the page walks (helper/fixtures/recorded/realfill-pages), which keep no fieldset legend or heading except a radio group's.","type":"note"}]}
